"This conversion is made using a PPM Encoder. This module sums up the 8 PPM "
"channels into a PPM-Sum type, which is supported by Erle-Brain."
msgstr "此转换使用 PPM 编码器完成。该模块将 8 个 PPM 通道合并为 Erle-Brain 支持的 PPM-Sum 类型。"

